743, not separate chips. All original MCU pin assignments and signal net names are retained.\nSignal paths are wired locally between MCU units, protection, passives and solder pads. Identical power/net labels connect regions on this sheet.\nNo JST-GH connectors or servo headers. XT30 supplies regulated 5V avionics only. Servo BEC remains a separate rail. USB-C and microSD retained.\n100nF capacitors and signal/bias resistors reduced to 0402; bulk, VCAP and regulator capacitors retained where effective capacitance needs margin. No IMU heater.\nPCB target: 50 x 50mm, six copper layers, components on top; actual fit/routing and thermal performance remain to be validated.\nRevision-two PCB is UNROUTED. Revision-one DRC failures are not claimed fixed. Custom firmware, bring-up and electrical review remain required." (at 251.46 812.8 0) (effects(font(size 1.35 1.35))(justify left top))(uuid "d222659f-caea-52af-aa01-f6a7b0745e1b"))(label "MAIN_PMOS_GATE"(at 109.22 66.04 180)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify right bottom))(uuid "6c607669-7ac3-5259-af26-15aa31699837"))(label "MUX_ILIM"(at 116.84 140.97 0)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify left bottom))(uuid "e5cbe4c3-d847-599e-81a2-1d168f728a3f"))(label "MAIN_VSNS"(at 76.2 140.97 180)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify right bottom))(uuid "f31359e8-6d52-5e95-943e-163cb0727da8"))(label "PWR_USB_SELECTED"(at 116.84 133.35 0)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify left bottom))(uuid "f36b519e-16d1-515a-9c63-aadd2f24e4e9"))(label "V5_USB_LIMIT"(at 76.2 133.35 180)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify right bottom))(uuid "35c4c11f-c97e-5b36-a25b-23b7fe571fe4"))(label "V3V3_CORE"(at 185.42 115.57 90)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify left bottom))(uuid "2179f74c-063b-58be-b2df-ce28e66ad043"))(label "V5_MAIN_IN"(at 55.88 67.31 0)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify left bottom))(uuid "96c4cbf4-67e7-5ce1-88d0-cb77c0285865"))(label "V5_MAIN_FUSED"(at 82.55 67.31 0)(effects(font(size 0.8 0.8))(justify left bottom))(uuid "20749720-